   "priceMinor": 185000,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Memento Mori – Sea is a one-of-one, hand-engraved Versa XC. Built on our Grade 5 Titanium case platform, the Trove VXC transforms its flat 40mm × 36mm surface from tool into canvas. This edition incorporates a bronze top plate and dial, creating an unexpected pairing of material and color. Engraver Robert Atkinson - a renowned tattoo artist and engraver based in Los Angeles - blends Western and Oriental traditions, engraving a classic tattoo-inspired skull framed by his signature crashing wave pattern. The piece brings the centuries-old tradition of Memento Mori to life on the wrist, created for a single collector. The winner of Memento Mori – Sea will have their name and date engraved on the Trove Edition caseback — leaving their trace forever on this one-of-one VXC. One Watch. One Story. One Winner.",
